	"description"		"
It is a fork of original mod [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3497629017]Autotester[/url]

[h3]Changes[/h3]
[list]
[*]Removed game close on warning or error (you could see the error in game logs)
[*]Added options for: generating translation report, spawn mod items, open mod options, change map size(minimum size is 100)
[*]It spawns content of all active mods one by one(except DLC)
[/list]

Settings file is located in the mod config-folder and compatible with original mod, filename ends with '3668363654_Autotester.xml'.
Here described how to find config: [url=https://ludeon.com/forums/index.php?topic=50995.0]https://ludeon.com/forums/index.php?topic=50995.0[/url]

[quote] [b]Warning:[/b] Because of the war in my country, electricity has become quite unpredictable. This means updates will come a bit slower than usual. Thank you for your support and for understanding my situation.[/quote]"
